name byo-twemojis
category Package
revision 58917
shortdesc "Build Your Own Twemojis" with TikZ
longdesc This package provides the means to create your own emojis (the
longdesc simple, round, and mostly yellow ones) from elements of
longdesc existing emojis. The provided command creates a TikZ picture
longdesc from the stated elements with multiple possibilities to modify
longdesc the result in color and position.
